WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Choose Ground as the target

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Pick the point whose height you want to set

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Pick anywhere on the intended plane

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
4. Set the required height

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.042
Motion replay: the moving block reaches its fitted pose.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:17.042
5. Apply and check the whole underside
